(7572553, 1215410, 86447, '<td valign="top">8 from me.   I really love the scene.   I feel like I''m there... looking up.<br/> <br/>It lacks a bit of... uhhh... richness, in my opinion.   I want it to be less "washed out"  (ha!).   But, really.<br/> <br/>And, I''d have gotten rid of the light fixture on the right.<br/> <br/>People "read" images from left to right... and this one was all clothing until I got to the "end" and it was about a light.<br/> <br/>But, still... it''s a solid 8 from me.</td>', '8 from me.   I really love the scene.   I feel like I''m there... looking up. It lacks a bit of... uhhh... richness, in my opinion.   I want it to be less "washed out"  (ha!).   But, really. And, I''d have gotten rid of the light fixture on the right. People "read" images from left to right... and this one was all clothing until I got to the "end" and it was about a light. But, still... it''s a solid 8 from me.', '2018-06-19 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
