(7573257, 1215746, 68504, '<td valign="top">If it were any clearer we would die from the stunning concatenation of elements. Like the strudels stretched out on the army cots. If you eat enough of them they will not only change your shape but the orientation of your stripes. Better have a smoke; and look! there is a fire alarm handy just in case. Or you could try to send a letter, but wait! it''s way too small for the mailbox: better to text. And best see a doctor about that ominous round shadow. Changing your underwear ain''t going to do it. lots of love.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-06-25 01:21:28.</i></td>', 'If it were any clearer we would die from the stunning concatenation of elements. Like the strudels stretched out on the army cots. If you eat enough of them they will not only change your shape but the orientation of your stripes. Better have a smoke; and look! there is a fire alarm handy just in case. Or you could try to send a letter, but wait! it''s way too small for the mailbox: better to text. And best see a doctor about that ominous round shadow. Changing your underwear ain''t going to do it. lots of love.', '2018-06-25 02:19:51.000000', '2018-06-25 02:21:28.000000', 0),
